      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『为了进军海外，想要了解\n海外的情况，是吧……首先饮食\n肯定是经典的切入点呢』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b5720b46167d45d91f80ef4ae89fc658bcff91c36104c9dbba6cd080e487c53",
