    {
      "uid": "zhcn:885b6648aa21ee05d5462bcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，没关系的。\n为了参加海外比赛这个大目标，\n必须一点一滴地积累才行呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7cee92270021de9d6e32fa1cb69d6a46fc5e0d172abd1c87107a1e0f18be0a7",
