      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28561289866402db05a064d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "企划敲定之后便是怒涛般的每一天。\n社区成员们承担了安排训练设施的任务，\n而我则为交涉出演事宜四处奔走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7221c13d85d1ec689bb623efddc8755e65bb6b60a4c7d3c819147d5bf027258c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
